        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "27-2.3. The Board shall provide each teacher with a $2,500 life insurance policy and a $2,500 death and dismemberment policy. Upon retirement, the life insurance coverage shall be deceased to $1,000 for each retired teacher, and the death and dismemberment policy shall be cancelled. The premium for the post-retirement life insurance in the amount of $1,000 shall be borne by the retiree.",
